| Command                  | Purpose                                   |
| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |
| ip addr                  | View network interfaces                   |
| ip route                 | View routing table                        |
| ip -6 route              | View IPv6 routes                          |
| ss -tulpen               | View listening services                   |
