| snort -V                 | Check Snort version                       |
| snort --daq-list         | List available packet acquisition modules |

### 10\. Recommended practical firewall assessment

Hands-on laboratory

Use this topology:

Test network / Internet

External test machine

Firewall

UFW / nftables / dedicated firewall

Internal network

Ubuntu server and test applications

Snort monitoring sensor

Observe traffic on suitable network monitoring points

Your objective is to establish whether the firewall's actual behaviour matches its intended security policy.

